// controlled-lifecycle self-closeout.
//
// The card's OWN bundle is generated by the PRODUCTION Graph closeout hook
//（runSubagentGraph → runColimaGraph → runMandatoryGraphCloseout →
// runCloseoutGate）, NOT by a hand-written source:
//   SA-R1 ‖ SA-R2 -> SA-W1 -> SA-V1
//   SA-W1 lifecycle: writer -> INDEPENDENT review agent -> PASS（or bounded
//   REPAIR, budget 1）-> re-review -> verifier.
//
// The graph runs WITH telemetry enabled（dogfooding the COST-1 passive
// observer on the real production Graph path — the graph is itself
// telemetry-observed）.
//
// Run: node scripts/cost1-self-closeout.mjs
//      node scripts/cost1-self-closeout.mjs --regenerate
//        --regenerate reuses the session's existing graph-closeout-evidence
//        (no colima re-run) and regenerates the bundle after the previous
//        generation is rotated by the operator.

